---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Mint CelebVeg wave 1 — 1 SOL"
  description="Mint one of 10 CelebVeg wave 1 pieces at 1 SOL. Early is best. Connect Phantom to mint."
  image="/assets/banner_v3.jpg"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="badge">Wave 1 • CelebVeg</span>
      <h1>Mint now — 1 SOL</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Ten pieces. Then wave 1 is history (again). Every later wave costs more. <strong>Early is best.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mt-6">
    <div class="stack" style="max-width:38rem">
      <div class="frame">
        <div class="inner">
          <img src="/celebveg/thumbs/0001.webp" alt="Featured: NAPOLEON BONAPART-SNIP" loading="lazy" style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; object-fit:cover;" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="badge-cream" aria-live="polite">
        <strong><span id="mint-remaining">–</span> / <span id="mint-available">10</span></strong> remaining
      </div>
      <div role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuenow="0" aria-label="Mint progress" style="height:10px; background:var(--bg-soft); border:1px solid rgba(13,29,80,.08); border-radius:999px; overflow:hidden;">
        <div id="mint-progress" style="height:100%; width:0%; background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--accent-purple));"></div>
      </div>

      <p>Price is 1 SOL, paid to the Xab Labs wallet, plus about 0.003 SOL in network fees.</p>
      <div class="trustbar">
        <div class="row">
          <div><strong>Collection</strong></div>
          <code class="mono" id="collection-address">CFuLSYMno9vMaiGUkkMHVyrpwhJcdCXMunVpaNAMmZTC</code>
          <a class="btn secondary" id="collection-link" href="https://explorer.solana.com/address/CFuLSYMno9vMaiGUkkMHVyrpwhJcdCXMunVpaNAMmZTC" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explorer</a>
          <button class="btn copy" type="button" data-copy="#collection-address">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <div class="row" style="color:#cbd5e1">
          <div>Metaplex Core on Solana • 3% royalties • Paid directly to Xab Labs</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding:12px;">
        <p class="mt-2" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">Wallet: <strong id="wallet-address">Not connected</strong></p>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <button id="connect-button" class="btn secondary" type="button">Connect wallet</button>
          <button id="mint-button" class="btn" type="button" disabled>Mint now — 1 SOL</button>
        </div>
        <div id="wallet-picker" style="display:none; margin-top:10px; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;" class="stack"></div>
        <div id="mobile-deeplinks" class="mt-3" style="display:none; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a id="open-phantom" class="btn secondary" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Phantom</a>
          <a id="open-solflare" class="btn secondary" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Solflare</a>
        </div>
        <p id="mint-message" class="mt-2">Connect a Solana wallet to mint.</p>
        <p style="display:none;">
          <a id="mint-explorer" class="btn secondary" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View your piece on Solana Explorer</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <details class="mt-4">
        <summary><strong>FAQ</strong></summary>
        <div class="stack mt-2">
          <p><strong>What is this?</strong><br/>CelebVeg is a Solana NFT collection where long‑dead historical figures are reduced to photorealistic produce and objects. It is funny on purpose.</p>
          <p><strong>How do I mint?</strong><br/>Connect a wallet and press Mint. You will approve the transaction in your wallet.</p>
          <p><strong>Which wallet?</strong><br/>Any Solana wallet: Phantom, Solflare, Backpack, MetaMask (Solana).</p>
          <p><strong>What’s a wave?</strong><br/>We release in waves. Wave 1: 10 pieces at 1 SOL. Every later wave costs more. Early is best.</p>
          <p><strong>Is it safe?</strong><br/>You approve every transaction in your wallet. We will never ask for your seed phrase.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <p class="mt-6">
        <a class="btn secondary" href="/celebveg">← Back to the collection</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script type="module">
    import { initMintPage } from '../../scripts/celebveg-mint.ts';
    initMintPage();
  </script>
</Base>

